  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Vétérinaires des Îles d'Or is a veterinary company run by Dr Christelle Luong Van Thi, based in Le Lavandou since 2007 (Infogreffe); the establishment is registered as open. It treats pets in the area.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The clinic is in the town centre, Résidence Urban Patio, 263 avenue des Ilaires. The Le Lavandou tourist office lists consultations by appointment, open all year: Monday to Friday 9:30am-12pm and 3pm-7pm, Saturday 9:30am-12pm and 3pm-5pm, closed Sunday. Phone: 04 94 71 19 26.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: consultations are by appointment, so call before you go, especially in season.</div>
      <p>Worth checking before you go: directories also give 15 avenue des Ilaires for the same practice, while the business register and the tourist office give 263; no official website or out-of-hours emergency service was found, so call the clinic.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Le Lavandou and its harbour are close by.</p>
